{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 27,
  "name": {
    "ja": "古い城",
    "en": "The Old Castle",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 50,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "街の古城が邪悪なモンスターどもに占拠されてしまいました。",
          "強力なアンデッド、邪悪な魔術師、ドラゴン、さらにはタイタンまでもが",
          "中にいると噂されています。城への入口はここの東の広い平地にあります。",
          "中にいる全てのモンスターを倒して下さい。報酬はとても価値のある",
          "アイテムです。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The old castle has been taken over by evil beings.  Mighty undead,",
          "evil spell casters, dragons, and even titans are rumored to be",
          "in there.  The entrance to the old castle is in a large clearing ",
          "east of here.  Destroy ALL the monsters within the castle, and your",
          "reward will be an artifact of great value.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["素晴らしい!! お礼を外に置いておきました。"],
        "en": ["Impressive!! Your reward is waiting for you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["この仕事はあなたには難しかったようですね。"],
        "en": ["It seems like this task was too difficult for you."],
      },
    },
  ],
